  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket that reports this problem. None of the retrieved tickets describe Command Palette blocking the \"|\" character in non-elevated apps while it works in elevated apps. The closest ones cover different issues: input problems with third-party extensions (#38732), autocorrect (#41557), and an alias character that wasn't typing because its extension wasn't running (#42204). As a workaround in the meantime, you can turn Command Palette off, or run the affected app as administrator. Please keep this ticket open and add details: check Command Palette's activation shortcut and any hotkey settings in case \"|\" is part of a keyboard layout or key combination, and attach a PowerToys bug report ZIP."
